{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（28日）中午12時10分，警方接報，白石角科學園19W大廈對開，一名男子倒臥在地，懷疑他從高處墮下，陷入昏迷。救援人員到場，將傷者送往威爾斯親王醫院搶救，惟最終證實不治。警方正調查事主身份及墮樓原因。</p><p>現場消息指，警員登上19W 2樓空中花園平台了解，經調查後，相信事主越過玻璃圍欄一躍而下。</p><figure><img alt=\"警員到場調查。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260628/1147894090076000256743950.jpeg/B1cLM7DdhmKP6r2tjhHcWzRdmyMZi7F4NU0XYxBNF2M\"/><figcaption>警員到場調查。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260628/1147894525901934592872054.jpeg/f0DyWzQ_7bnI4tZ2TRkg-PGQQwOqFajDkjGJXbcxiV0\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員進入科學園19W大廈調查。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260628/1147890166266990592690138.jpeg/NyVDmxa_g7Rz2cYzxhTAvbwdFwNNscRRgo7wGKeO8Bg\"/><figcaption>警員進入科學園19W大廈調查。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員進入科學園19W大廈調查。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260628/1147890163540561920409835.jpeg/JHsYTTlkgnII7qa-uUzpSDWR5_fy0dMpiJj7462Y--M\"/><figcaption>警員進入科學園19W大廈調查。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-28T06:02:08.247421+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":221,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}